If one of the property values above is missing, the default value for the missing property will be inserted.

We can also style lists with colors, margins and padding, to make them look a little more 
interesting.

Anything added to the <ol> or <ul> tag, affects the entire list, while 
properties added to the <li> tag will affect the individual list items:

